	<text xml:lang="la">
		<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" subtype="metadata" n="1">Da der Brief Nachrichten vom Tag zu <placeName ref="l199" cert="high">Hagenau</placeName> enthält, steht das Jahr zweifelsfrei fest.</note>
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Salus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">In comitiis<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Zum Religionsgespräch in <placeName ref="l199">Hagenau</placeName> s. oben <ref target="file11442">Nr. 1399</ref>, Anm. 9.</note> nichil etiamnum actum est <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>aliud, nisi quod nostri confessionem <placeName ref="l18">Augustanam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>sive Saxonicam obtulerunt commissariis<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">am 2. Juli; s. <bibl source="b62">ADRG</bibl> I/1 89-91; <bibl source="b480">PC</bibl> III 79.</note>; nunc <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>expectamus, quid sequuturum sit.<pb type="edition" next="136"/></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Commissarii, quibus negotium commissum, sunt quatuor: <lb xml:id="p1z6"/><persName ref="p7671">Treverensis episcopus</persName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><persName ref="p7671">Johann III. von Metzenhausen</persName>, Erzbischof und Kurfürst von <placeName ref="l1028">Trier</placeName>.</note> et <persName ref="p7572">Argentinensis</persName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p7572">Wilhelm von Honstein</persName>, Bischof von <placeName ref="l491">Straßburg</placeName>.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>dux <persName ref="p18549">Ludovicus Baioarius</persName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p18549">Ludwig X.</persName>, Herzog von <placeName ref="l619">Bayern</placeName>.</note> et <persName ref="p18548">Ludovicus Palatinus</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><persName ref="p18548">Ludwig V.</persName>, Kurfürst von der <placeName ref="l2477">Pfalz</placeName>.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Duobus ex commissariis principibus visum est omnino <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>auspicandum negotium a restitutione spoliatorum, alteris <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>duobus a religione<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Letzteres war die Meinung von <placeName ref="l1028">Trier</placeName> und <placeName ref="l2477">Pfalz</placeName>; vgl. <bibl source="b62">ADRG</bibl> I/1 53, 14-19.</note>; quum igitur inter ipsos convenire <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>non potuerit, ad regem<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p18477">Ferdinand I.</persName>, <placeName ref="l425">römischer</placeName> König.</note> negotium est relatum, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>qui illorum sententiae subscripsit, qui a religione incipien<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>dum putaverunt.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">De restitutione posteriore <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>loco tractandum.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Sic cor regis in manu <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>domini<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Spr 21, 1</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>In fędere nobis adverso<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Gemeint ist der 1538 in <placeName ref="l361">Nürnberg</placeName> gegründete katholische Gegenbund.</note> extra episcopos nulli sunt <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>principes praeter <persName ref="p18549">Baioarium</persName> et <persName ref="p20318">Brunsvicensem</persName><note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><persName ref="p20318">Heinrich IX. d. J., Herzog von Braunschweig-Wolfenbüttel</persName>.</note>; igitur <persName ref="p17959">legatus <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>pontificis</persName>, qui hic agit<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><persName ref="p17959">Giovanni Morone</persName>; s. <bibl source="b456">NBD</bibl> V, S. LXXXI V-LXXXVI.</note>, pollicitus est papae nomine <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>50000 in parata pecunia, ut foedus illud <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>amplietur<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Papst <persName ref="p19981">Paul III.</persName> war dem Bund am 9. Juni beigetreten und hatte als Bundesbeitrag 50'OOO Dukaten hinterlegt; s. ebd., bes. S. LXXVIII- LXXX.</note>; nam quosdam absterrent impensae.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Qui congregati sint in comitiis, habes ex <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>scheda literis addita<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">Ein Bericht über die Ankunft der verschiedenen Delegationen ist in einer Abschrift von <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Hand überliefert; s. Zürich StA, E II 347, 180f.</note>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Hec tibi et reliquis <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>bonis fratribus significare libuit, cum quibus <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>bene vale, praecipue cum <persName ref="p8127">Pellicano</persName>.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">14. iulii.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Tuus <lb xml:id="p1z25"/><persName ref="p4079">Io. Zvick</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Domino <persName ref="p495">Hainricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName> anti<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>stiti, fratri suo charissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
